#: ../../../../../../.conda/lib/python3.14/site-packages/pygmt/src/legend.py:docstring
#: of pygmt.src.legend.legend:3
msgid ""
"Makes legends that can be overlaid on plots. It reads specific legend-"
"related information from an input file, a :class:`io.StringIO` object, or "
"automatically creates legend entries from plotted symbols that have labels. "
"Unless otherwise noted, annotations will be made using the primary "
"annotation font and size in effect (i.e., :gmt-term:`FONT_ANNOT_PRIMARY`)."
msgstr ""

